# POC demo, not production

This project is a **proof of concept for a live demo**. It is OK if it is not production-ready.

- Ship local FOSS substitutes so a walkthrough works without Entra, AKS, E2B cloud, org GitHub Apps, Rekor, or paid model SKUs.
- Do not block features on tenant keys. Do not claim those services are live.
- Cookie login + demo directory (`PHASE1_DEV_MODE`) is the demo identity.
- Keep architecture FOSS tools; Entra and GitHub Enterprise stay client-SoW commercial and out of the demo path.
- Prefer a complete demo loop (intake → gates → artefacts → catalog) over hardening.
